WEBVTT

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:07.400
No!

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.140
Help me... Onii-chan!

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:12.360
I won't let any bad guys live!

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.280
It's hot, Onii-chan!

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.870
I just wanted to save someone in trouble.

00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:24.460
One of these days, I'm sure we'll stop caring about all that stuff.

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:26.670
What... was that?

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:28.940
Oh no...

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:30.250
Quon...

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:31.980
Quon-sama...

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:33.630
I...

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:42.440
I saw Quon consumed with rage.

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:45.230
No. No!

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:50.190
I have to... protect everyone!

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:52.440
So you are Insania!

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:57.550
Quon, did you kill people?

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:04.680
Yes, I did.

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:15.710
Chapter Four 「Crimson Anxiety」

00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:15.830
The truth is always cruel.

00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:25.980
He's an enemy, yet he's one of us.

00:01:32.370 --> 00:01:34.440
Your condition is unstable.

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:54.380
How's Epsilon doing?

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:58.110
His adrenaline and dopamine levels are fluctuating.

00:01:58.450 --> 00:02:01.140
He's in a very unstable condition.

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:02.930
What happened to him?

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:04.180
We're not sure.

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:07.490
Are you analyzing his data?

00:02:07.490 --> 00:02:08.900
We are.

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:13.750
It's an easy task to analyze visual and aural data,

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:17.250
but this time, it's a cerebral problem.

00:02:17.630 --> 00:02:21.030
So you're saying you're not familiar with emotional problems?

00:02:23.590 --> 00:02:25.680
Epsilon's unstable.

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:27.160
We should format him.

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:31.440
I've told you before: that would be boring.

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:33.300
Formatting him would be a simple task,

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:39.000
but this is the perfect chance to gain data about emotional struggles.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:43.190
Who knows how this might benefit future technology?

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:45.390
Fine.

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:48.200
You can use him as your toy for a while.

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:50.140
But when I give the order...

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:52.450
format him immediately.

00:03:02.940 --> 00:03:04.580
Hey, make sure to wipe him clean.

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:08.950
Hey!

00:03:09.490 --> 00:03:11.420
You liar!

00:03:12.110 --> 00:03:13.960
Stop, you two!

00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:18.260
Ryo-san.

00:03:18.260 --> 00:03:20.580
Rule number 2!

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:21.760
No fighting.

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:22.950
I know!

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:25.680
But he said that Quon killed people!

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:32.230
I saw it.

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:37.110
That's all a lie!

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:38.600
I saw it too.

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:39.290
Me too.

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:40.610
I don't know anything about it.

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:43.110
Does anyone know the truth?

00:03:43.340 --> 00:03:46.120
I saw it, but I won't believe it.

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:08.350
Are you okay?

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:10.850
It's dangerous if you run off like that.

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:14.230
Murderer...

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:18.770
Quon, you killed people, didn't you?

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:24.190
I'm sorry.

00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:27.400
That was only meant for me,

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:30.040
but you happened to see it.

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:34.950
If you could, I'd like you to forget about it.

00:04:34.950 --> 00:04:37.520
No, I want you to remember it,

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:39.460
so that you won't become like me.

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:43.220
Will I become a monster too one day?

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:49.460
No, you won't.

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:54.230
Just remember what you saw and never become like that.

00:04:54.970 --> 00:04:57.470
I did kill people,

00:04:57.470 --> 00:05:00.980
but that's why I'll protect you and do everything I can.

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:21.460
I thought you didn't like these things.

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:24.600
Sometimes I have an unstoppable urge to eat them.

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:33.940
Boy, that was good!

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:34.890
Thank you.

00:05:37.860 --> 00:05:39.150
Thank goodness.

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:43.070
Quon, you've been living forever, right?

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:44.250
Yeah.

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:49.070
You've lived a long time, yet you still regret what you did in the distant past.

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:53.890
When I realized that you don't have all the answers, even at your age,

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:56.370
I felt good about being human.

00:05:57.730 --> 00:06:02.500
Still, doesn't that mean you can fall in love again, despite having lived for a millennium?

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:09.930
Was that so funny?

00:06:12.670 --> 00:06:14.820
Sorry, I didn't mean to laugh.

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:18.190
That just came out of nowhere.

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:23.190
Thanks.

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:32.330
I read your report.

00:06:32.810 --> 00:06:35.690
Is their organization's headquarters really in Zero Area B?

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:38.830
Yes, though that's just a hypothesis.

00:06:39.980 --> 00:06:44.710
Over the years, we've found these Zero Areas, which don't emit any larva signals,

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:47.290
and we've confirmed that there are three of them in the capital.

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:53.850
Furthermore, when Insania captures larvae, they can no longer be traced or detected.

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:58.980
It's possible they have a force field of some sort that erases larva signals.

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:01.480
Do any of them exhibit force fields?

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:02.620
No.

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:05.740
We don't know why these Zero Areas emerge,

00:07:05.740 --> 00:07:11.450
but it would require a vast amount of energy to create a force field large enough to thwart our radar.

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:14.390
It would be impossible to create a force field in all three locations.

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:18.620
Then the other day, case C73 happened.

00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:20.720
Canceling format!

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:24.330
I've identified a wave pattern belonging to a third person.

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:29.320
We've been unable to pinpoint where the interference wave originated,

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:33.030
but we can make estimations using probability.

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:38.770
And Zero Area B is very close to the most probable origins we've calculated.

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:44.840
So the headquarters of an organization aiding Insania is somewhere in this area?

00:07:44.840 --> 00:07:45.770
Yes.

00:08:00.860 --> 00:08:02.280
Quon-sama...

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:06.520
Millennium Tree...

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:11.050
you've been watching him all these years.

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:16.360
Please, tell me his pains.

00:08:23.830 --> 00:08:25.530
Quon-sama?

00:08:35.830 --> 00:08:36.970
Watch it!

00:08:36.970 --> 00:08:38.230
Jerk.

00:08:44.010 --> 00:08:48.380
No one helps when it really comes down to it.

00:08:48.720 --> 00:08:50.300
I need to save them.

00:08:50.580 --> 00:08:52.650
Who made you the king?

00:08:52.650 --> 00:08:54.170
Yeah, right, you can do it.

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:55.260
Just don't even try.

00:08:55.990 --> 00:09:00.350
That's the least I can do... for all the sins I've committed.

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:05.980
Quon-sama, where are you?

00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:09.860
Can you hear my voice?

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:12.860
Why do you close your heart even to me?

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:19.470
Hey, missy. Who you looking for?

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:22.160
Should we help you?

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:23.830
No, thank you.

00:09:25.720 --> 00:09:27.770
We're saying we'll help.

00:09:27.770 --> 00:09:28.880
Please let me go.

00:09:29.110 --> 00:09:33.630
Hey, isn't this cute.

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:35.340
Stop!

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:37.930
Tei!

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:39.690
Larva signal.

00:09:39.690 --> 00:09:40.680
Level red detected.

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:43.000
She's a new target.

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:44.350
Can your toy move?

00:09:44.590 --> 00:09:46.640
I think Epsilon will be okay.

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:49.150
Send out the Cyborg Unit.

00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:51.650
What's the big deal?

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:53.730
It's just a hair pin.

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:56.790
If you want it back, then play with us.

00:09:56.790 --> 00:09:57.610
Get away from me!

00:09:57.610 --> 00:09:59.820
What, you don't want it?

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:01.560
No...

00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:03.740
You're in danger.

00:10:08.010 --> 00:10:10.280
What are you saying, anyway?

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:17.020
Hey! How the hell do you know about my girlfriend's body?

00:10:17.020 --> 00:10:17.710
What?

00:10:17.710 --> 00:10:20.140
Hey, what are you saying?

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:21.900
Didn't you hear him?

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:24.650
He said she looks like my girlfriend!

00:10:24.650 --> 00:10:26.930
That she has the same curves!

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:27.430
What?

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:30.350
What do you mean by "Work something out, dumbass"?

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:32.600
Why would you say that?

00:10:32.600 --> 00:10:34.180
I didn't say anything!

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:37.060
Wait.

00:10:37.060 --> 00:10:38.410
Let's calm down.

00:10:38.410 --> 00:10:40.120
Something's wrong.

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:42.200
Did you hear voices?

00:10:50.560 --> 00:10:52.120
Please stop!

00:10:52.120 --> 00:10:53.680
Don't look at me!

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:55.380
If you look at me,

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:58.030
you'll be looking into your own hearts.

00:10:58.030 --> 00:11:00.090
You'll see your ugliest thoughts.

00:11:05.380 --> 00:11:06.010
Huh?

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:16.730
I actually never liked you from the start!

00:11:18.140 --> 00:11:20.740
Fucking Dad. I'll never forgive him!

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:25.960
Please don't send your hatred to me.

00:11:25.960 --> 00:11:28.330
I'll only strengthen your feelings.

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:31.530
This is your fault?

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:46.040
Extermination of the infecteds, complete.

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:48.710
Proceed immediately to formation 05.

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:50.930
Will you be okay?

00:11:52.550 --> 00:11:53.670
I can do this.

00:12:03.440 --> 00:12:04.780
N-No...

00:12:09.630 --> 00:12:10.700
Stay back.

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:25.260
Quon-sama!

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:26.800
Insania.

00:12:36.510 --> 00:12:38.750
Proceed to formation 27.

00:12:58.580 --> 00:12:59.820
Quon-sama!

00:13:09.190 --> 00:13:09.850
Onii...

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:13.880
Onii-chan.

00:13:24.880 --> 00:13:25.700
Quon-sama.

00:13:26.970 --> 00:13:28.570
Stop!

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:30.990
Tei is not your sister!

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:35.210
No! No! No!

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:37.330
I didn't kill my sister!

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:40.460
Larva signal level yellow detected.

00:13:40.620 --> 00:13:41.960
I-It's...

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:44.700
What? Is it a new target?

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:45.830
It's Epsilon.

00:13:45.830 --> 00:13:47.470
We've detected a larva signal from Epsilon.

00:13:47.810 --> 00:13:48.590
What?

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:50.950
Should we disconnect him?

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:52.930
Wait!

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:54.450
That's not what you would do.

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:56.940
We should get raw data from the larva.

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:10.450
Shun!

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:18.670
Signals have reached level red.

00:14:32.380 --> 00:14:33.970
Destroy Epsilon.

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:36.380
Roger.

00:14:36.380 --> 00:14:37.910
Relaying to WTOC.

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:39.230
Destroy Epsilon imme—

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:40.850
Wait!

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:45.690
If we disconnect him right now,
we'll lose a larva we could monitor.

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:46.230
Tell them again.

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:49.740
Cyborg team, destroy Epsilon immediately.

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:53.900
Roger, we'll destroy Epsilon.

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:56.830
Delta, what's wrong?

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:58.690
Oh, nothing.

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:17.930
Fire.

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:22.850
Activate infrared sensor.

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:25.360
It's not working. They've jammed the signal.

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:26.540
Damn.

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:28.030
You okay?

00:15:29.120 --> 00:15:30.310
Get it together.

00:15:30.310 --> 00:15:31.490
But Quon-sama...

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:37.030
Wh-What are you doing?

00:15:38.960 --> 00:15:40.760
He's also one of us.

00:15:40.760 --> 00:15:41.540
We have to save him.

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:43.750
He's our enemy.

00:15:44.220 --> 00:15:46.090
No! Not right now!

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:47.590
Goodness.

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:51.410
Insania and three other larvae are on the move.

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:52.760
We'll pursue.

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:56.630
No. Though they're injured, four's a big number.

00:15:56.630 --> 00:15:58.830
We'll have to think of a new strategy.

00:15:58.830 --> 00:16:00.260
Return to base.

00:16:00.260 --> 00:16:03.320
Isn't it optimal to hit them when they're weakened?

00:16:03.320 --> 00:16:04.920
Return!

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:06.270
Roger.

00:16:12.050 --> 00:16:13.780
This is ridiculous.

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:18.280
His nervous system is expanding and eroding his mechanical tissues.

00:16:18.510 --> 00:16:20.330
I can't handle this.

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:21.690
Midori-kun, it's all yours.

00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:23.290
Okay, I'll give it a try.

00:16:23.630 --> 00:16:25.940
Why in the world did you bring him here?

00:16:25.940 --> 00:16:27.700
We didn't have a choice.

00:16:27.700 --> 00:16:29.120
Considering the circumstances—

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:31.260
Don't use big words!

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:34.190
You always do as you please.

00:16:34.190 --> 00:16:36.550
Couldn't you have talked with us before you brought him back?

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:40.810
I'm sorry. I should have, but he was hurt.

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:43.300
You should've just left him there!

00:16:43.300 --> 00:16:45.190
He's one of us!

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:46.290
Still!

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:47.670
Be quiet!

00:16:47.670 --> 00:16:50.690
We're in the middle of emergency surgery!

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:53.440
Not like you need to save him.

00:16:54.380 --> 00:16:57.090
Look, I'm a doctor!

00:16:57.090 --> 00:16:59.890
A doctor treats everyone, enemies and allies alike.

00:16:59.890 --> 00:17:02.380
They're all patients, understand?

00:17:12.220 --> 00:17:17.470
Do you guys know the phrase, "The lion spares the suppliant"?

00:17:17.810 --> 00:17:20.670
And I've heard that the Bedouin, a desert tribe,

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:26.690
welcome anyone who enters their tents as guests, even a person who had killed their parents.

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:27.940
Still...

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:32.110
If we throw him out of here, he'll lose his place in this world.

00:17:32.580 --> 00:17:36.200
You, most of all, should know how painful that is.

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:45.410
So, how was he able to pass all of our tests?

00:17:47.810 --> 00:17:53.670
About case SR23Q, where his family was killed...

00:17:54.220 --> 00:17:55.230
We looked into it.

00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:58.890
However, there was little evidence because everything had been burned...

00:17:59.880 --> 00:18:03.900
so we had to trust Epsilon's testimony.

00:18:04.320 --> 00:18:07.190
I never thought he had altered his memories.

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:09.190
You didn't investigate?

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:10.470
We did.

00:18:10.470 --> 00:18:13.900
We investigated carefully using all types of scanning tests.

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:17.570
However, we didn't find anything wrong.

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:23.870
We're currently strengthening the scan tests and will retest Alpha through Delta.

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:25.330
That's a given.

00:18:25.810 --> 00:18:29.230
But why did he become a monster now?

00:18:29.230 --> 00:18:31.900
We believe the reason is the EEG interference incident.

00:18:32.680 --> 00:18:41.240
Our guess is that the interference caused his forgotten memories to resurface.

00:18:41.240 --> 00:18:44.350
His ability must have resurfaced along with the memories.

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:46.180
I see.

00:18:46.950 --> 00:18:51.220
In any case, your team is fully responsible for this failure.

00:18:51.220 --> 00:18:52.110
Do you understand?

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:54.220
Y-Yes.

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:03.120
Where am I?

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:05.120
Oh, you're awake?

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:10.250
You've been unconscious for three days.

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:14.860
Don't try to get up yet.

00:19:14.860 --> 00:19:19.660
I don't know why, but your biological and mechanical tissues are fusing together.

00:19:19.660 --> 00:19:20.930
So don't try to move.

00:19:23.450 --> 00:19:25.720
Where am I?

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:29.060
Well...

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:31.310
This is the Fantasium Garden.

00:19:36.090 --> 00:19:37.400
It's you!

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:43.160
We met in the dream.

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:50.200
This is the hideout of the supernaturals that Custos is looking for.

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:52.370
Quon! Are you sure you should be telling him?

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:55.500
I know, but he's like us.

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:57.220
No, you don't!

00:19:57.220 --> 00:20:00.880
Not everyone's agreed on saving him, you know?

00:20:02.600 --> 00:20:06.730
Kazami Shun, we will welcome you as a comrade.

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:08.430
Quon!

00:20:09.170 --> 00:20:10.720
Are you sure?

00:20:10.720 --> 00:20:14.380
I might report this to headquarters.

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:20.440
Well, with trust comes the risk of being betrayed.

00:20:22.630 --> 00:20:26.200
Are you... saying you'll trust me?

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:35.710
Can I be alone?

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:37.350
Sure.

00:20:49.780 --> 00:20:51.970
You still haven't located Epsilon?

00:20:52.410 --> 00:20:54.970
He's completely disconnected.

00:20:54.970 --> 00:20:58.180
We believe there's some sort of jamming in effect.

00:20:58.180 --> 00:21:01.940
Isn't it the operators' jobs to find him anyway?

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:04.490
Who gave you permission?

00:21:07.880 --> 00:21:08.870
Commander...

00:21:09.180 --> 00:21:13.010
A cyborg needs permission to enter here.

00:21:13.010 --> 00:21:14.620
Who gave you permission?

00:21:17.550 --> 00:21:18.820
Go back.

00:21:19.150 --> 00:21:21.470
I'll overlook this just once.

00:21:22.640 --> 00:21:26.380
Is Epsilon still missing?

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:30.390
Even if he was found, I'm not obligated to tell you.

00:21:42.800 --> 00:21:44.190
Excuse me.

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:51.230
A doll should know its place.

00:21:54.600 --> 00:21:58.650
And a doll should be useful to people.

00:22:00.680 --> 00:22:03.240
Like how Epsilon was.

00:22:07.580 --> 00:22:09.300
What are we going to do?

00:22:09.300 --> 00:22:12.120
That's what we need to discuss!

00:22:12.120 --> 00:22:14.790
We shouldn't have saved him.

00:22:14.790 --> 00:22:16.810
It's all your fault, Quon.

00:22:16.810 --> 00:22:18.490
Do you understand?

00:22:18.490 --> 00:22:20.900
He caught our friends,

00:22:20.900 --> 00:22:22.810
and even killed them!

00:22:22.810 --> 00:22:26.620
You remember how it felt when they were killed in front of you!

00:22:26.620 --> 00:22:29.960
Is that now all in the past because he's awakened to his power?

00:22:30.950 --> 00:22:32.990
Then I shouldn't be forgiven as well.

00:22:34.730 --> 00:22:36.500
That was a long time ago!

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:39.000
But it's still the same sin as I've committed.

00:22:42.780 --> 00:22:46.130
Maybe we should give him a chance too.

00:22:46.130 --> 00:22:47.610
Why?

00:22:47.610 --> 00:22:50.070
He should be killed!

00:22:50.070 --> 00:22:50.890
Isn't that right?

00:22:50.890 --> 00:22:53.650
Then will you condemn him?

00:22:53.650 --> 00:22:56.890
Will you condemn him and tell him he's to be executed?

00:22:59.750 --> 00:23:05.730
None of us can condemn him, so we should give him a chance.

00:23:06.360 --> 00:23:10.730
A chance for him to admit to his sins and repent.

00:23:13.350 --> 00:23:15.090
You're so kind, Tei,

00:23:15.090 --> 00:23:18.410
but kindness isn't always right.

00:23:18.740 --> 00:23:22.370
Kindness sometimes corners a person.

00:23:39.910 --> 00:23:45.150
Will the songs I sing be about...

00:23:45.860 --> 00:23:47.570
What did you try to do to me?

00:23:48.340 --> 00:23:50.320
It sounded like you were in pain.

00:23:57.000 --> 00:23:59.310
Is this your ability?

00:24:23.370 --> 00:24:26.190
I had a full system maintenance just the other day.

00:24:26.190 --> 00:24:29.100
Well, we can never be too cautious.

00:24:29.100 --> 00:24:33.410
The data in my body parts is always linked to the data center.

00:24:33.410 --> 00:24:35.920
What's there to be cautious about?

00:24:35.920 --> 00:24:37.310
True.

00:24:37.310 --> 00:24:42.250
The fact is, you might go looking for him by yourself if I don't keep you here.

00:24:43.130 --> 00:24:48.150
Even if I go out to look for him, I'll be monitored constantly,

00:24:48.150 --> 00:24:50.500
and you should be able to locate me at all times.

00:24:50.500 --> 00:24:53.720
Yet look at our situation with Epsilon.

00:24:54.880 --> 00:24:57.640
You're really worried about him, aren't you?

00:24:57.640 --> 00:24:59.660
It's the natural thing to do for a comrade.

00:25:01.000 --> 00:25:03.990
So people lie even as cyborgs.

00:25:03.990 --> 00:25:06.480
Your adrenaline level is rising.

00:25:06.480 --> 00:25:09.480
If you had a heart, I'm sure your heart rate would be increasing.

00:25:19.240 --> 00:25:20.330
Hey!

00:25:20.330 --> 00:25:21.750
Come and get me!

00:25:21.750 --> 00:25:23.080
Give it back!

00:25:23.080 --> 00:25:24.530
Hey, come back here—

00:25:29.530 --> 00:25:31.870
That's enough playing for today.

00:25:31.870 --> 00:25:33.570
It's time for dinner.

00:25:33.570 --> 00:25:34.610
What are we having today?

00:25:34.610 --> 00:25:35.470
Curry?

00:25:36.980 --> 00:25:39.240
They're just kids.

00:25:39.880 --> 00:25:41.390
I...

00:25:44.090 --> 00:25:46.230
We also have the right to live.

00:25:48.580 --> 00:25:51.230
We just want to live. That's all we want.

00:25:53.610 --> 00:25:57.740
But your existence threatens order.

00:25:58.430 --> 00:25:59.540
Order?

00:25:59.940 --> 00:26:02.240
Is that more important than people's lives?

00:26:07.210 --> 00:26:08.230
Can you feel it?

00:26:08.810 --> 00:26:10.030
It's warm.

00:26:10.640 --> 00:26:14.530
Maybe it's different from normal people,

00:26:14.530 --> 00:26:16.590
but we're human.

00:26:16.590 --> 00:26:18.840
You aren't human.

00:26:19.170 --> 00:26:20.870
Then what are you?

00:26:20.870 --> 00:26:22.640
Your hand is so cold.

00:26:25.840 --> 00:26:27.060
I'm...

00:26:29.880 --> 00:26:31.190
...a monster.

00:26:33.040 --> 00:26:35.190
If we're monsters...

00:26:36.130 --> 00:26:38.310
But we're human.

00:26:38.310 --> 00:26:40.310
And so are you.

00:26:40.310 --> 00:26:43.010
You're just a little different from normal people.

00:26:43.010 --> 00:26:43.740
What are you doing?

00:26:44.200 --> 00:26:46.050
It's a chip for security.

00:26:46.050 --> 00:26:51.320
If you keep this on, they won't find you. It will also restrain your ability.

00:26:51.800 --> 00:26:52.750
May I?

00:26:55.620 --> 00:26:56.740
Thank you.

00:27:01.180 --> 00:27:02.800
I don't understand.

00:27:03.080 --> 00:27:04.500
Understand what?

00:27:04.500 --> 00:27:09.310
Why did you give the order to destroy Epsilon?

00:27:09.630 --> 00:27:12.440
You probably wouldn't understand,

00:27:12.440 --> 00:27:14.570
but it was all for order.

00:27:18.560 --> 00:27:19.850
Order?

00:27:19.850 --> 00:27:22.490
Is that more important than people's lives?

00:27:22.490 --> 00:27:24.090
It's delicious!

00:27:24.090 --> 00:27:26.800
We just want to live. That's all we want.

00:27:28.720 --> 00:27:30.050
I'm...

00:27:30.380 --> 00:27:31.730
...a monster.

00:27:43.680 --> 00:27:45.570
Are you feeling better now?

00:27:45.570 --> 00:27:49.270
Yeah, that Kiri girl sang for me.

00:27:53.550 --> 00:27:55.300
Why did you come get me?

00:27:55.300 --> 00:27:58.430
I'm sure it's suffocating being inside the room all day,

00:27:58.430 --> 00:28:01.530
and there aren't many people out and about after the park closes.

00:28:09.160 --> 00:28:12.530
It's been so long since I last saw the moon...

00:28:12.980 --> 00:28:15.040
or even just cared about the night sky.

00:28:15.540 --> 00:28:17.840
He's headed your way!

00:28:17.840 --> 00:28:19.550
Watch my back, Epsilon!

00:28:34.900 --> 00:28:36.450
She's practicing.

00:28:36.450 --> 00:28:37.600
Practicing?

00:28:37.600 --> 00:28:38.320
Yes.

00:28:38.320 --> 00:28:42.800
We're all afraid of our powers.

00:28:42.800 --> 00:28:44.070
What do you mean?

00:28:44.680 --> 00:28:46.320
Like trees, for example.

00:28:46.820 --> 00:28:49.660
Just as tall trees root deep into ground,

00:28:49.660 --> 00:28:56.080
we need to be as strong as our powers, or we'll fall.

00:28:56.550 --> 00:29:01.630
That's why they practice to learn how to control their powers.

00:29:02.470 --> 00:29:06.340
Otherwise, their powers will devour them.

00:29:07.050 --> 00:29:08.350
Larva burst...

00:29:08.780 --> 00:29:09.510
Hm?

00:29:09.510 --> 00:29:12.100
Oh, um, it was nothing.

00:29:13.270 --> 00:29:14.610
I see.

00:29:14.610 --> 00:29:19.350
They were just fearful of their own powers and panicked.

00:29:20.380 --> 00:29:24.280
I was trying to grow taller without rooting myself in the ground.

00:29:24.880 --> 00:29:29.510
No, I wasn't trying. They made me.

00:29:37.440 --> 00:29:38.580
Are you okay?

00:29:39.620 --> 00:29:40.380
Stop that!

00:29:43.270 --> 00:29:45.020
Why did you stop me?

00:29:45.020 --> 00:29:48.600
He... He killed Yuriko-chan!

00:29:48.600 --> 00:29:50.800
Like she was some kind of an animal!

00:29:53.550 --> 00:29:54.810
You can't do this.

00:29:57.050 --> 00:29:58.440
I hate you, Tei!

00:30:02.840 --> 00:30:06.280
I hated all of you.

00:30:06.990 --> 00:30:12.200
I always believed that one of you killed my sister.

00:30:12.200 --> 00:30:14.240
That's why I volunteered for Custos.

00:30:14.660 --> 00:30:17.250
Their mission was to hunt people like you.

00:30:17.690 --> 00:30:18.980
But...

00:30:18.980 --> 00:30:20.670
The one who killed my sister was...

00:30:26.300 --> 00:30:28.750
I can't say that I understand you.

00:30:28.750 --> 00:30:32.550
You'll have to carry this darkness yourself.

00:30:32.550 --> 00:30:35.350
Just like how Quon-sama has his own darkness.

00:30:35.880 --> 00:30:40.850
I was supposed to be fighting monsters, but I can't believe I was one of them.

00:30:53.910 --> 00:30:57.840
And I've become a much uglier monster.

00:30:59.010 --> 00:31:00.220
Don't move.

00:31:42.170 --> 00:31:44.620
I can't stay here.

00:31:45.880 --> 00:31:48.210
Still, where can I go?

00:31:48.210 --> 00:31:50.510
I can't go back there.

00:31:50.510 --> 00:31:53.260
But I can't stay here.

00:31:58.500 --> 00:32:00.350
He's leaving.

00:32:00.350 --> 00:32:02.240
Oh, well.

00:32:02.240 --> 00:32:04.420
He chose this path himself.

00:32:04.420 --> 00:32:07.360
Won't they find out about this place?

00:32:07.550 --> 00:32:13.520
I altered all his network-related programs when we healed him, so we should be fine.

00:32:16.400 --> 00:32:19.180
We've received Epsilon's location data.

00:32:19.180 --> 00:32:20.840
Just as planned.

00:32:20.840 --> 00:32:23.960
Switch his control over to the main system.

00:32:23.960 --> 00:32:24.500
Roger.

00:32:26.960 --> 00:32:28.410
This is odd.

00:32:28.410 --> 00:32:30.970
His location transmitting program isn't running.

00:32:30.970 --> 00:32:32.840
How are we catching this?

00:32:32.840 --> 00:32:35.440
We have multiple programs on him.

00:32:35.440 --> 00:32:38.530
Even if one program is altered, a different program gets executed.

00:32:38.530 --> 00:32:40.570
You knew?

00:32:40.890 --> 00:32:44.790
Did you think they'd accept a thing like Epsilon?

00:32:44.790 --> 00:32:47.020
He's a monster above all monsters.

00:32:47.020 --> 00:32:51.990
Is that why you purposely allowed Insania to take him away?

00:32:52.590 --> 00:32:57.270
There's no better use for a traitor than as bait.

00:33:04.210 --> 00:33:06.680
We've gained control of him.

00:33:06.680 --> 00:33:09.180
Access his visual and aural data.

00:33:09.180 --> 00:33:10.950
Figure out where he's been.

00:33:10.950 --> 00:33:12.060
Roger.

00:33:12.060 --> 00:33:14.050
Put the cyborg team on standby.

00:33:14.050 --> 00:33:16.050
Make sure they can leave as soon as we find something.

00:33:16.050 --> 00:33:19.180
Cyborg units Alpha through Delta, to standby.

00:33:20.100 --> 00:33:24.720
We've accessed Epsilon's data, and we're just about done analyzing.

00:33:25.400 --> 00:33:27.020
We have his current location.

00:33:27.380 --> 00:33:29.120
He's at a green park in Shinjuku.

00:33:29.120 --> 00:33:33.060
There's a facility called Fantasium Garden nearby.

00:33:33.060 --> 00:33:35.950
Cyborg team, move out!

00:33:36.620 --> 00:33:38.860
Cyborg team, move out!

00:33:55.720 --> 00:33:59.970
Now, let's have Epsilon launch the first blow.

00:33:59.970 --> 00:34:01.790
By himself?

00:34:01.790 --> 00:34:04.210
Insania would be there too.

00:34:04.210 --> 00:34:05.850
It's a very risky mission.

00:34:06.190 --> 00:34:08.430
This isn't a mission.

00:34:08.430 --> 00:34:11.730
It's a hunt to kill every single one of them!

00:34:16.240 --> 00:34:18.730
Stop. Stop!

00:34:19.790 --> 00:34:21.500
Please stop!

00:34:32.640 --> 00:34:34.380
Don't worry. Come with me.

00:34:34.710 --> 00:34:36.730
We've lost Epsilon.

00:34:36.730 --> 00:34:39.160
Their jamming shield is blocking transmissions.

00:34:39.160 --> 00:34:40.260
We're fine.

00:34:40.260 --> 00:34:42.260
I altered his program.

00:34:42.260 --> 00:34:45.490
He should destroy the shield program on his own.

00:34:46.340 --> 00:34:49.600
Don't... Don't make me do this!

00:34:51.480 --> 00:34:53.160
Please!

00:34:57.140 --> 00:34:58.240
Wait!

00:34:59.000 --> 00:35:00.740
Stop, Shun!

00:35:02.450 --> 00:35:03.280
Shun!

00:35:09.130 --> 00:35:11.950
Shun, please stop.

00:35:11.950 --> 00:35:12.920
Shun!

00:35:17.940 --> 00:35:19.260
Insania detected.

00:35:19.460 --> 00:35:21.540
We have Epsilon back on radar.

00:35:21.540 --> 00:35:24.510
It seems we've successfully destroyed their shield.

00:35:24.510 --> 00:35:27.900
That makes it easier for the cyborg team to move.

00:35:27.900 --> 00:35:30.520
Display Epsilon's visual data.

00:36:00.370 --> 00:36:03.510
A kid like that was Insania?

00:36:03.510 --> 00:36:07.590
This Insania thing is very intriguing.

00:36:10.520 --> 00:36:12.440
Stop, Shun!

00:36:12.660 --> 00:36:14.350
I'm not doing this!

00:36:14.350 --> 00:36:16.060
My body's moving on its own!

00:36:16.410 --> 00:36:17.440
What?

00:36:17.440 --> 00:36:20.400
They're trying to make us fight!

00:36:23.370 --> 00:36:25.570
Everyone, hurry up and get away!

00:36:25.570 --> 00:36:27.950
Where's my bear? Where's my bear?

00:36:29.830 --> 00:36:31.040
We'll find him later.

00:37:07.120 --> 00:37:08.680
Please stop!

00:37:09.290 --> 00:37:10.790
I don't want to do this either!

00:37:11.110 --> 00:37:12.390
Kill me!

00:37:12.390 --> 00:37:16.000
Kill me, or I'll even attack the children!

00:37:16.000 --> 00:37:18.020
I can't do that!

00:37:18.020 --> 00:37:20.000
If you don't, people will die!

00:37:34.330 --> 00:37:36.900
Good job, Epsilon.

00:37:37.130 --> 00:37:40.900
Don't call me by some symbol! My name is Kazami Shun!

00:37:40.900 --> 00:37:42.900
You are Epsilon.

00:37:47.260 --> 00:37:49.910
Proceeding to exterminate Insania.

00:37:50.330 --> 00:37:51.160
Run, Quon!

00:37:51.160 --> 00:37:55.470
They're equipped to kill you!

00:37:56.970 --> 00:37:58.920
I can't run away.

00:37:59.280 --> 00:38:01.130
I have to protect the kids.

00:38:10.870 --> 00:38:12.060
That got my ribs.

00:38:13.670 --> 00:38:15.040
Focus on Insania.

00:38:26.240 --> 00:38:28.980
This won't proceed like it usually does.

00:38:31.180 --> 00:38:32.080
Quon!

00:38:41.130 --> 00:38:42.090
Quon!

00:38:46.300 --> 00:38:49.380
As if I'd fall for the same trick twice.

00:38:51.070 --> 00:38:54.130
Here. I'll break more of your ribs.

00:38:58.690 --> 00:39:00.150
When did these get here?

00:39:11.560 --> 00:39:14.700
I knew I should've killed you back then!

00:39:16.370 --> 00:39:17.300
Run!

00:39:17.300 --> 00:39:19.080
Or I'll end up killing you!

00:40:05.880 --> 00:40:07.130
Larva burst confirmed.

00:40:07.130 --> 00:40:10.070
We've lost control of Epsilon.

00:40:10.070 --> 00:40:11.760
That's ridiculous!

00:40:11.760 --> 00:40:14.830
It's impossible for him to cut off our controls on his own!

00:40:14.830 --> 00:40:17.620
It's impossible for a larva to be one of our cyborgs.

00:40:18.460 --> 00:40:20.330
There's no change in orders.

00:40:20.330 --> 00:40:22.890
Destroy the traitor cyborg.

00:40:23.570 --> 00:40:26.630
Tei, take him and run.

00:40:26.630 --> 00:40:27.650
What about you?

00:40:27.860 --> 00:40:32.030
I'm going to fight the people I should be fighting.

00:40:39.450 --> 00:40:40.120
Damn it.

00:40:46.590 --> 00:40:47.450
Shun!

00:40:47.450 --> 00:40:50.800
Oh, no. I'm your opponent.

00:40:57.170 --> 00:40:58.370
Not bad.

00:41:15.850 --> 00:41:17.320
Quon!

00:41:34.120 --> 00:41:38.510
Quon!

00:41:45.500 --> 00:41:47.520
Insania exterminated.

00:41:47.520 --> 00:41:49.040
Really?

00:41:53.660 --> 00:41:55.280
Retreat.

00:41:55.700 --> 00:41:58.530
Sir, there are numerous supernaturals here.

00:41:58.840 --> 00:41:59.950
We should capture them.

00:41:59.950 --> 00:42:01.840
I said retreat.

00:42:02.270 --> 00:42:03.290
Roger.

00:42:07.080 --> 00:42:09.870
That was easier than I thought.

00:42:12.800 --> 00:42:15.550
We're not going to hunt them?

00:42:15.720 --> 00:42:17.510
I've changed by mind.

00:42:25.830 --> 00:42:27.390
Quon...

00:43:12.440 --> 00:43:17.490
Feel Rock emotion! Burning Rock emotion!

00:43:17.490 --> 00:43:25.700
A scream of my burning soul that seems to burst out of my chest

00:43:17.490 --> 00:43:25.490
mune no oku hajike sou na atsui tamashii no sakebi wo

00:43:25.700 --> 00:43:32.250
Burst on the fire

00:43:45.970 --> 00:43:51.100
I was struck by thunderstorm, suddenly awakening my instinct

00:43:45.970 --> 00:43:51.100
raiu ni utare totsuzen mezameta honnou

00:43:51.100 --> 00:43:55.650
It burns on, pushing aside my sensibility

00:43:51.100 --> 00:43:55.650
risei wo oshinokete moetagiru no sa

00:43:55.650 --> 00:44:00.740
The truth is written on the walls of memory

00:43:55.650 --> 00:44:00.740
kioku no kabe ni kakikomareta shinjitsu wa

00:44:00.740 --> 00:44:05.070
No one can violate it

00:44:00.740 --> 00:44:04.950
dare ni mo okasenai

00:44:05.070 --> 00:44:14.500
We have no questions; we just want to break the structure of this world with our hands

00:44:05.200 --> 00:44:14.460
gimon nante nai kono sekai no shikumi wo buchikowashichimae so no te de

00:44:14.500 --> 00:44:24.680
Clear up the fate that befalls me, and then run to the future! Get on!

00:44:14.500 --> 00:44:24.680
furikakaru sadame kirihiraki ima mirai e kakenukero! Get on!

00:44:24.680 --> 00:44:29.560
Feel Rock emotion! Burning Rock emotion!

00:44:29.560 --> 00:44:34.100
With an unknown power second to none,
I will change the direction of the wind

00:44:29.560 --> 00:44:34.100
dare ni mo makenai michi no chikara de kazemuki wo kaero

00:44:34.100 --> 00:44:39.110
Feel Rock emotion! Burning Rock emotion!

00:44:39.110 --> 00:44:47.280
We will face everything before us in our time

00:44:39.110 --> 00:44:47.030
me no mae no subete ni tachimukai oretachi no jidai e

00:44:47.280 --> 00:44:54.120
Burst on the fire

00:45:07.550 --> 00:45:12.680
Reality has been assembled like a nightmare

00:45:07.550 --> 00:45:12.680
akumu no you na kumikomareta genjitsu ni

00:45:12.680 --> 00:45:17.270
Even if we lose our place, and it's filled with shit

00:45:12.680 --> 00:45:17.270
yukiba ushinatte funtsumattemo

00:45:17.270 --> 00:45:22.320
If we never lose the courage to get hurt

00:45:17.270 --> 00:45:22.320
kizutsuku yuuki itsudemo nakusanai nara

00:45:22.320 --> 00:45:26.740
Our answers will not change

00:45:22.320 --> 00:45:26.660
kotae wa kawaranai

00:45:26.740 --> 00:45:36.250
We have no plans; we just want to break inconsistencies in this world

00:45:26.820 --> 00:45:36.250
dasannante nai konosekai no mujun wo buchikowashitai soredake

00:45:36.250 --> 00:45:46.300
Passing through the darkness, release that closed-off future! Get on!

00:45:36.250 --> 00:45:46.300
kurayami wo nukete tozasareta mama no asu wo tokihanate! Get on!

00:45:46.300 --> 00:45:51.100
Feel Rock emotion! Burning Rock emotion!

00:45:51.100 --> 00:45:55.640
Hate, love, and the power of will changes everything

00:45:51.100 --> 00:45:55.640
